WEBVTT

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.600
DearMom and Dad,

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.270
Thanks for the strawberries, Mom.

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:18.570
I'll share them with everyone
right away tomorrow.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.640
I'm looking forward to the exhibit, Dad.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.770
We'll all be coming to see it for sure.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:31.180
I'll take you both to that ramen shop
we were talking about.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.810
It's the best.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.320
Let's all go eat together.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:38.520
I'll be looking forward to it.

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:40.820
Tatsuma

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.400
T o Ryuj i :
Th is is the best
C h ristmas Eve ever!

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:16.760
I pray i n the dark

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:28.560
I ma tsumetai kaze ni fukarete

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:37.070
Futo miushinatta jibun wo mita

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:41.650
I roasete kiete yuku

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:45.890
Kao no nai hitogomi no naka de

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:49.960
Utagoe wa todokanai

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:55.190
Kakikesarete shimau kara

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.770
Kotaete

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:01.970
Inori wa hakanaku

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:06.280
Kiekakesou na negai

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:12.650
Itami wa kesenai kedo

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:18.860
Kotoba de hikari wo atsumeru

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:23.160
Kanata e todoku you ni

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:29.800
Namida wa kesenai kedo

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:35.470
I pray in the dark

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.710
Hiyu did?

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.920
I can't believe that!

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.750
It's only natural,

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:47.880
after what happened to his family.

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:51.210
It's not just that though.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:54.350
There's also something going on
inside him right now.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.160
Something deep down that we can't see.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:03.400
It was like he was trying with all his might to hold
something back that's fighting to get out.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:09.940
I thought he'd feel better if I forced
it out into the open.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:12.440
I might have known.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.110
So, he's the same, is he?

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:17.910
The same as I was.

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:23.890
Are you saying that Hiyu's got the same
kind of power inside as you?

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.690
Well, I don't know for certain,

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:29.990
but if it is one of the Four Guardians' powers,

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:33.700
and he cannot control that power,

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.000
it will only lead to destruction and death.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.560
Destruction and death...

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:44.230
Could Hiyu be meaning to
take on Chaos himself?

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:49.750
We owe Hiyu quite a lot.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.380
I believe this is our time to pay him back.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.820
I agree.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.830
Let's look for him.

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:02.620
We are the only ones who can stop him now.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.030
The Seventh Night

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:11.500
Stars of Fate Chapter

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.230
Story of Genbu ~ Chaos

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.440
He can't have gone far in the shape he's in now.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.410
Split up and search the area around here!

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:58.420
Do you think we need to stop Hiyu too, Daigo?

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:01.720
I don't want him to repeat the
same mistakes that I made.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:05.720
But his parents were murdered!

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:10.050
Daigo?

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:16.190
Ouch!

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.700
I'm okay.

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.500
It's nothing.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.740
You gotta do it with more gusto, Koni!

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:28.200
Oh, good grief! C'mon, squeeze them!
Do it with love!

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:36.110
This is...

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:40.060
What's wrong?

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.530
Are you okay?

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:43.990
Yeah, it's nothing.

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:03.640
It just won't do, bringing that at
Christmas instead of cake.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:20.490
Tatsuma, that's not the way you fight.

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.290
Hiyu...

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:32.140
So, let's face our fate without any fear,

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:34.440
even if we don't know where it might lead us.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.220
Don't do it, Hiyu, not that power.

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:53.660
Hiyu...

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:00.200
Hiyu...

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.670
You and Mom are okay, right, Dad?

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:04.940
Oh, no, it's nothing.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:06.500
See you.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:11.440
But Hiyu's parents were murdered.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:30.670
Nobody's come to take away their bodies, huh?

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:34.630
The son is the only one they left
behind, the adolescent.

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:37.270
Poor kid...

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:40.780
Oh, by the way, have you seen Mr. Mikuriya?

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.910
I haven't seen him since this morning.

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:56.990
He's me!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.700
He's me from...

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.330
From back then!

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:04.000
Did you see the news?

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.340
Yeah, it was the parents of that
guy from Class B, right?

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:08.540
That's what they say.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.270
Ah, that's what I thought!

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:14.210
Hey, they said today's remedial
lessons are cancelled!

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:20.550
Mr. Inugami, the staff meeting has started.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.520
It's about Hiyu from Class 3-B.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.880
All right...

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.930
By the way, who is that?

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:31.960
He's been standing over there for a while now.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.760
Shall I call the police?

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:38.200
It's a sad thing,

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.870
having instincts just a little sharper than the rest.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.140
Excuse me?

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:44.440
Oh, nothing.

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:53.810
What's the matter?

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:58.650
I am Chaos!

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:03.590
Wh..What did you say?!

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:11.600
What, are you in shock because
your parents were killed?

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.870
Here I am.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.910
I'm right here.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.950
Here, right here!

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:27.580
Over here!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.320
Do you hate me?

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:31.290
Do you want to kill me?

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.090
I'll take you there.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:50.600
Your parents' blood was so warm!

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:53.950
They were crying for you to help them.

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:56.740
They were all, "Hiyums! Oh, Hiyums!"

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:13.360
Someone... Someone help!

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.780
Say "ah"!

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:34.250
A good Christmas cake really
makes Christmas, huh?

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.120
You sure love your sweets, don't you?

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:40.060
You're so spoiled.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:44.960
Hey, I'm right here!

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:46.970
Come find me quick!

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:49.090
What was that? Is someone coming?

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.800
Santa Claus!

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:56.030
You're such a dork.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:04.220
Hiyu, I don't want you to make
the same mistake I did!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:06.510
What are you talking about now?

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:09.090
You're already a killer.

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.630
You killed your closest friend.

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:16.260
Have you forgotten about him already?

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:19.560
How awful! You can bet his spirit
is holding a grudge.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:24.630
You're wrong! I... I...

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.500
You sure about this?

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:31.640
Is it okay for you to be here?

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.750
While you're out here, your family...

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.210
...might be dying.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:45.250
You've been thinking that your own
family might be killed, right?

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:51.120
It might be your little brother or sister this time.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.390
Stop it!

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:57.000
Do the burns still hurt?

00:11:57.700 --> 00:11:59.700
You couldn't protect them.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:02.370
How many people died because of you?

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:05.830
They were all screaming...
"lt hurts!" "l can't breathe!" "Help us!"

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.850
Who is it? Who are you?

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:10.050
Chaos...

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.680
You're Chaos, aren't you?

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.290
Hey, it's not your problem.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.090
Hiyu's a lost cause.

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:19.060
May as well kill him yourself.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.630
Right!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.590
It'd be easier that way.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.790
Kyochee...

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.230
Hide 'n seek, huh?

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:30.200
Shit, this ain't no kiddie game!

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:37.300
I told you to bring in the laundry, Kyouko!

00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:54.880
You play too; this is a game after all.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.760
It's no fun if we don't all play together.

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:00.760
C'mon, come out and play.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.760
Over here...

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.730
I'm this way.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:57.660
Does it make you sad?

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.960
Or is it painful?

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.760
How does it feel right now?

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:04.890
Tell me, Hiyu!

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:33.660
What are you looking at?

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:34.530
I'm right here.

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:35.830
Right here!
I'm right here.

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:38.300
Damn, talk about elaborate tactics.

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:41.260
It's like the whole damn town is the enemy!

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:45.040
All these people are being controlled.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.000
Where's the real one?

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:50.540
Guys! Are you all right?!

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.840
Aoi! Aoi!

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:55.380
I'm okay! I'm right here!

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.510
Sakurai! Guys!

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:25.280
Anko!

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:26.280
Anko?!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.900
Anko!

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:52.900
Now, all the actors are in place.

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.630
Sagaya?

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:00.240
Hiyu!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.870
Tatsuma!
Hiyu!
Hiyu!

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:04.840
Anko!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.320
Tatsuma!
Hiyu!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.250
Can you hear my voice?

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:11.380
Hey, Tatsuma!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.290
Merry Christmas!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:21.290
Say, did you all believe in Santa Claus
when you were children?

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:24.930
You?

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:29.130
Did you ever force yourselves to act happy
when you knew he didn't exist?

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:31.410
Like me?

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:33.210
Allow me to introduce myself once again.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:35.250
Welcome all.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:37.710
I am Chaos.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:42.480
I am the one who had Hiyu's parents killed.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:46.490
So, how do you feel right now, Hiyu?

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.550
Does it hurt?

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:51.600
Why would you do this?

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:53.330
Huh? Oh, no reason.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:57.460
Though it was pretty amusing to
feel the knife bite into flesh.

00:16:57.970 --> 00:16:59.770
What the hell are you talking about?

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:05.070
Hiyu!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.410
Why Tatsuma's parents?

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:11.380
I told you, no real reason.

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:15.420
Stop worrying about every little thing!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:18.990
The truth is none of you guys
really do care, right?

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:22.760
Everyone gets all excited over
the fact that it's Christmas,

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:25.730
but is anyone doing that because
they actually think it's fun?

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:28.430
Aren't they just doing like everyone else

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:31.230
because they'll feel uneasy if they don't?

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:34.940
You see, since the day I was born,

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:38.400
I've never thought that things were
"fun" or "sad" or whatever.

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:42.940
I've never gotten to like or hate
anyone in particular either.

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.180
I tried making some friends

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:48.790
and doing all the fun-sounding things,
like basketball or karaoke,

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.580
but I didn't feel a thing.

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:55.850
Even sleeping with my model girlfriend
didn't do a thing for me.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:18:01.890
That's why I was so excited when my powers
awoke and I started the Chaos game.

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:05.840
It was the first time I'd ever felt anything was fun.

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:09.970
I was able to experience all sorts of things
through the game's participants!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:15.510
But even that gradually became boring.

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:22.170
That was when I found you all.

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.360
You've had no idea,

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:30.320
but I've been watching you all along.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:33.360
You've been watching us?

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:38.860
You always looked like you were
having fun, no matter what.

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:42.840
Yes, it felt like you were all truly "alive".

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:45.910
Especially that Hiyu.

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:48.250
He seemed to be the most alive of anyone.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.870
The sensation was the strongest in him.

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:56.980
That is why I chose Hiyu and his parents.

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:05.830
Huh? Oh, no, total silence!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.730
Was this really so much of a shock?

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.000
This guy has no soul.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.000
He's completely empty.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.140
Hey, Tatsuma!

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:16.840
Get over here, Tatsuma!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.740
Hey! You hear me, don't ya?!

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:19.980
What's your problem?

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:22.550
After all I said, and you ignore me?

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.340
Oh, I know!

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:27.590
I just thought of something totally great.

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:30.050
It doesn't get more exciting than this!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:35.090
Say, Hiyu, do you hate me now
that I've killed your parents?

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:39.050
So, you probably want to kill me, right?

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:42.130
Well, everyone, how about we make a little bet?

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:45.430
Over whether Hiyu will kill me
right here and now.

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.940
Personally, I'd bet he does kill me,

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:49.270
but what do you say?

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:50.510
What's the matter with you?!

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:52.580
So, what do you say, Hiyu?

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.180
If you don't kill me now,

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:57.950
I might have everyone else's families killed!

00:19:57.950 --> 00:19:58.950
How about beating me to death?

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:00.380
Or maybe you could burn me?

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.350
Well, what do you say?

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.890
Or could it be that the rest of you are like me,

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:07.520
and your "families" are all a big act?

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:10.690
If your little brother's or sister's head was
blown off right before your eyes,

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:12.660
would you give it a second thought?

00:20:13.430 --> 00:20:16.400
Hiyu! Enough, enough already!

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:18.640
Just do as he wishes!

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:20.170
Kill him, just like he wants!

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:20.810
Komaki!

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:21.740
Komaki!
Quiet!

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:22.810
That scum...

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:25.240
If Hiyu won't do it, then l...

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:27.540
I'll kill him!

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.380
What do you think you're doing?

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:32.220
Stop it!
What do you think you're doing?

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:33.320
I will not!

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:34.320
Komaki!
I will not!

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:35.890
But... but!

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:37.590
Will you get a handle on it?!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.190
Hey, Tatsuma!

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:40.990
Aren't you going to snap out of it?

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:43.330
You wanna get your ass whooped
by Maria again?!

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:45.760
If you don't get a grip and open your eyes,

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.730
then this time I'll knock you flat!

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:51.030
You haven't forgotten about the fight
we had that time, have ya?

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:54.000
Well, we never did settle that one!

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:56.340
You listening to me?!

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:57.970
Hey, Tatsuma!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:20:59.840
Tatsuma!

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:07.850
Hiyu!

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:09.480
Hiyu!
Tatsuma!

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:28.940
Tatsuma!

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:32.400
What do you use that fist for?!

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:37.410
Yes, there is power in this hand.

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:41.620
The power to protect all those people.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:45.680
Hiyums!

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:30.770
What the hell?

00:22:30.770 --> 00:22:33.740
I gave you the perfect chance.

00:22:41.850 --> 00:22:46.950
